+\============================================================
+23\. Acceptance Closure
+\============================================================
+
+Independent Review PASS 后建立 acceptance closure。
+
+至少记录：
+
+\- task\_id
+\- accepted candidate SHA
+\- old PDF path
+\- old PDF SHA-256
+\- new canonical Markdown path
+\- new Markdown SHA-256
+\- semantic\_change = false
+\- PDF retained = true
+\- PDF unchanged = true
+\- Product Contracts unchanged = true
+\- Product implementation unchanged = true
+\- independent review PASS
+\- verifier PASS
+\- Recorder PASS
+
+\============================================================
+24\. Merge to main
+\============================================================
+
+只有：
+
+fresh independent Review PASS
+\+
+acceptance closure complete
+
+之后才能 merge to main。
+
+优先：
+
+fast-forward only
+
+如果 main 已分叉：
+
+不要 force。
+
+如果 reconciliation 改变 candidate 内容：
+
+旧 Review PASS 不再覆盖新内容。
+
+必须重新：
+
+verify
+→ fresh Review
+→ acceptance closure
+
+然后才可 merge。
+
+\============================================================
+25\. Post-Merge Verification
+\============================================================
+
+main 合入后再次验证：
+
+1\. main clean；
+2\. final main SHA；
+3\. PDF exists；
+4\. PDF SHA unchanged；
+5\. Markdown exists；
+6\. Markdown SHA matches canonical manifest；
+7\. Markdown is active canonical Frozen Architecture；
+8\. PDF is historical snapshot；
+9\. architecture authority references point to Markdown；
+10\. verifier PASS；
+11\. Product Contracts unchanged；
+12\. Product implementation unchanged；
+13\. Recorder run valid。
+
+\============================================================
+26\. Frozen Authority Effective Point
+\============================================================
+
+只有：
+
+accepted
+\+
+merged to main
+\+
+post-merge verifier PASS
+
+之后：
+
+Markdown 才正式成为 Frozen Architecture canonical source。
+
+记录：
+
+\`canonical\_architecture\_effective\_from\_commit\`
+
+以及：
+
+\`canonical\_architecture\_effective\_at\`
+
+迁移前：
+
+PDF remains historically authoritative.
+
+迁移后：
+
+Markdown becomes authoritative.
+
+不得 retroactively 改写过去。
+
+\============================================================
